      <a href="tel:+989007000462" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-400 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 transition-colors">تماس فوری</a>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 py-10 mt-4">
